// `emit_mono.vl` — the emitter's per-callsite MONOMORPHIZER: the eager
// pre-pass that clones a generic lifted function (explicit `<T>` params or
// un-annotated inference holes) into one concrete instance per distinct
// call-site shape (`monomorphize` → `monoWalk` → `monoInstantiate` →
// `monoMakeInstance`), plus the HOF callback baking and lambda-pinning that
// specialization needs. Consults the classifiers and re-runs the collection
// passes after minting instances (`monoRebuild`); writes no bytes. Carved out
// of `wasmEmit.vl` (review N18).

